# Deploy credentials for `npm run deploy` / `npm run migrate` — copy to
# .env.deploy (gitignored) and fill in. A token scoped for THIS project:
#
#   Account · Workers Scripts · Edit    upload the worker + its assets
#   Account · D1 · Edit                 wrangler d1 migrations apply --remote
#
# Dashboard → My Profile → API Tokens → Create Token → Create Custom Token.
# `npm run deploy:check` names any permission the token is still missing.

